# Every change requires review from the repository owner.
#
# Syntax is <path-pattern> <owner>, and owners must be prefixed with @.
# A bare username is parsed as a file pattern with no owner, which silently
# assigns no reviewer at all — the rule appears to exist but does nothing.
#
# This encodes roadmap §2's rule that merging is always the owner's action,
# making it a repository setting rather than a convention to remember.

